Horse: Oh? You’re far away from the Palace. Do you need me to take you back?
Horse: …
Horse: So you’ve been looking for me. My apologies, I’ve been incredibly busy preparing for Chinese New Year. It is, after all, the Year of the Horse. 
Horse: What troubles brought you to me?

