- ...
	Horse: Hesitating?
	- I’m scared of your answer. It might reveal the truth I can't face.
	Horse: I’m sure you met several of the Zodiacs on your way here. They all seemed to have given you different advice.
	- Yes
	Horse: I’m sure you already have the answer you seek. What you need is not advice...but courage.
	- ...
	Horse: I will tell you a bit about myself. I am passionate and independent. This year, I am the Fire Horse that will trailblaze through Heaven and Earth. 
	Horse: But I am also stubborn. I hate routine and dislike being restricted. There is nothing I dislike more than having my freedom stripped away. 
	Horse: But, you’ve never experienced that freedom before, have you?
	
	- ...No, I haven’t
	Horse: Then I will offer one advice as well: take the path less traveled by. 
	Horse: It is scary, lonely, and perhaps even tiring.
	Horse: But you will surprise yourself with the people you will meet and the scenery you will see. 
	Horse: Look around you at this foreign land far away from the Palace. You have already taken the first step to freedom. 
	Horse: Do you like it so far?
	
